    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "DICTIONARIES\n",
        "A Simple Dictionary"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1jx57LHn87h8"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0={'color':'green','points':5}\n",
        "print(alien_0['color'])\n",
        "print(alien_0['points'])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9pzlYOmiXEhZ",
        "outputId": "60b8b8c4-1263-47d6-acd2-2e4e6cfe7db9"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "green\n",
            "5\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Working with Dictionaries**\n",
        "A dictionary in Python is a collection of key-value pairs. Each\n",
        "key is connected to a value, and you can use a key to\n",
        "access the value associated with that key."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dlxMyEOYXv59"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Adding New Key-Value Pairs"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7rzFQnMfYNeO"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0 = {'color': 'green', 'points': 5}\n",
        "print(alien_0)\n",
        "alien_0['x-coordinates']=0\n",
        "alien_0['y-coordinates']=25\n",
        "print(alien_0)\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "TAtvXFA8YQT1",
        "outputId": "300382d8-004f-48e7-cfa2-04e78c81bd09"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "{'color': 'green', 'points': 5}\n",
            "{'color': 'green', 'points': 5, 'x-coordinates': 0, 'y-coordinates': 25}\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Modifying Values in a Dictionary"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "KpM1N_7TZYYO"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0 = {'color': 'green'}\n",
        "print(f\"The alien is {alien_0['color']}.\")\n",
        "alien_0['color'] = 'yellow'\n",
        "print(f\"The alien is now {alien_0['color']}.\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "a6SstQPJZZGz",
        "outputId": "61faa6ab-f333-4ce1-fb7f-f90ca6f37355"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "The alien is green.\n",
            "The alien is now yellow.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0 = {'x_position': 0, 'y_position': 25, 'speed': 'medium'}\n",
        "if alien_0['speed']=='slow':\n",
        "  x_increament=1\n",
        "elif alien_0['speed']=='medium':\n",
        "  x_increament=2\n",
        "else:\n",
        "  x_increament=3\n",
        "# The new position is the old position plus the increment.\n",
        "alien_0['x_position']=alien_0['x_position']+ x_increament\n",
        "print(f\"New position: {alien_0['x_position']}\")\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "P1RswwuxZ1M7",
        "outputId": "0eefb32f-bf68-45de-f306-fb85a00e54cf"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "New position: 2\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Removing Key-Value Pairs"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "K8-_Nbm-qtth"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0 = {'color': 'green', 'points': 5}\n",
        "print(alien_0)\n",
        "\n",
        "del alien_0['points']\n",
        "print(alien_0)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
