            "C\n",
            "Rust\n",
            "Python\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "matically be included in the output.\n",
        "6-5. Rivers: Make a dictionary containing three major rivers and the\n",
        "country each river runs through. One key-value pair might be 'nile': 'egypt'.\n",
        "Use a loop to print a sentence about each river, such as The Nile runs\n",
        "through Egypt.\n",
        "Use a loop to print the name of each river included in the dictionary.\n",
        "Use a loop to print the name of each country included in the dictionary."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ql1cFdiI-rEB"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "rivers = {\n",
        "    'nile': 'egypt',\n",
        "    'ganges': 'india',\n",
        "    'amazon': 'brazil'\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "# Print a sentence about each river\n",
        "for river, country in rivers.items():\n",
        "    print(f\"The {river.title()} runs through {country.title()}.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nThe following rivers are included:\")\n",
        "# Print the name of each river\n",
        "for river in rivers.keys():\n",
        "    print(river.title())\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nThe following countries are included:\")\n",
        "# Print the name of each country\n",
        "for country in rivers.values():\n",
        "    print(country.title())"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "R531LsuH-uf4",
        "outputId": "5323dd2c-15d2-473c-c655-41fc7149abce"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "The Nile runs through Egypt.\n",
            "The Ganges runs through India.\n",
            "The Amazon runs through Brazil.\n",
            "\n",
            "The following rivers are included:\n",
            "Nile\n",
            "Ganges\n",
            "Amazon\n",
            "\n",
            "The following countries are included:\n",
            "Egypt\n",
            "India\n",
            "Brazil\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Nesting:A List of Dictionaries"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qjz5ZO_fBYYr"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "alien_0 = {'color': 'green', 'points': 5}\n",
        "alien_1 = {'color': 'yellow', 'points': 10}\n",
        "alien_2 = {'color': 'red', 'points': 15}\n",
        "\n",
        "aliens=[alien_0,alien_1,alien_2]\n",
        "for alien in aliens:\n",
        "  print(alien)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "hwu_21FnBZER",
        "outputId": "0ab04704-6d79-45bb-81ba-0bba53cf678b"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "{'color': 'green', 'points': 5}\n",
